ent-WeaponSonicBlaster = sonic blaster
    .desc = A favoured sonic weapon of Slaanesh's Noise Marines. It hurls waves of distorted harmonics that tear flesh apart and pulverise organs with impossible pressure.

ent-WeaponScreamerPistol = screamer pistol
    .desc = A compact sonic sidearm often carried by champions and commanders of the Emperor's Children. It spits short shrieking riffs and long discordant wails that literally rip a target apart with sound.

ent-WeaponBlastmaster = blastmaster
    .desc = A heavy two-handed sonic weapon used by Noise Marines. It fires throbbing bass pulses and ruinous sonic crescendos that can burst eyes, rupture organs, and hurl victims back in a concussive wave.

ent-NoizeMarineBlastmasterGrenade = blastmaster shell
    .desc = A compact sonic munition for the Blastmaster that releases a destructive resonance on impact.
